[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13201.59, "timestamp": "03:40:01", "text": "岛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13204.55, "timestamp": "03:40:04", "text": "不，我已经下载好了。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13208.229, "timestamp": "03:40:08", "text": "你的网速有多快？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13210.07, "timestamp": "03:40:10", "text": "我有个预测，你肯定知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13212.91, "timestamp": "03:40:12", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13216.87, "timestamp": "03:40:16", "text": "哪个男人？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13218.469, "timestamp": "03:40:18", "text": "等等，我觉得它可能会改变质量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13222.269, "timestamp": "03:40:22", "text": "你那边也一样。我做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13231.71, "timestamp": "03:40:31", "text": "质量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13239.11, "timestamp": "03:40:39", "text": "哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13241.03, "timestamp": "03:40:41", "text": "因为在我看来，情况看起来非常好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13243.75, "timestamp": "03:40:43", "text": "好的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13245.429, "timestamp": "03:40:45", "text": "我不知道为什么情况看起来不太好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13249.83, "timestamp": "03:40:49", "text": "为你。我知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13252.07, "timestamp": "03:40:52", "text": "等等，我应该用别的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13254.95, "timestamp": "03:40:54", "text": "色键？或许。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13257.99, "timestamp": "03:40:57", "text": "是的，你可以试试。我应该用蓝色吗？"}]